---
layout: base.njk
description: Writing on how immersive experiences are designed, measured and made to travel.
title: Insights
permalink: /insights/
---
<section class="section">
  <h2 class="section-title">{{ home.insights_section.title }}</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">Writing on how immersive work is designed, measured and made to travel.</p>
  <div class="insights-grid">
    {% for post in collections.insights %}
    <article class="insight-card"{% if post.data.image or post.data.keyart %} style="--card-art: url('{{ post.data.image or post.data.keyart }}')"{% endif %}>
      <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
      <a class="read-more" href="{{ post.url }}">Read Article →</a>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
